[Desktop Entry]
Type=Application
Name=Virtual Keyboard & Mouse
Name[zh_CN]=虚拟键鼠
Name[zh]=虚拟键鼠
Comment=Open the ArmadaOS lower-screen input panel manually; on desktop, wait for Game Mode
Comment[zh_CN]=手动打开 ArmadaOS 副屏虚拟键鼠；桌面模式点击后等待进入游戏模式
Comment[zh]=手动打开 ArmadaOS 副屏虚拟键鼠；桌面模式点击后等待进入游戏模式
Exec=/usr/bin/systemctl --user restart thor-panel.service
Icon=armada-dual-screen-input
Terminal=false
Categories=Utility;Accessibility;
